Regional Market Insights
•	Asia-Pacific: The Asia-Pacific region stands as the undisputed leader in the global wheel speed sensor market, propelled by a powerful combination of a massive automotive manufacturing base, rapid technological adoption, and strong government support for vehicle safety standards.
